@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
title C4 L2 — logical containers (baseline 1.0)
left to right direction
actor Owner as owner
rectangle Telegram as tg <<External>>
rectangle "Local Mac boundary" {
 rectangle "macOS App\nPresentation / lifecycle controls" as ui <<Application>>
 rectangle "Core Host\nUse cases + Telegram adapter + jobs" as core <<Application>>
 rectangle "Inference Worker\nLocal speech / language / image adapters" as ai <<Application>>
 rectangle "macOS Agent\nSystem API adapter (conditional)" as agent <<Application>>
 database "SQLite Store\nAggregates, revisions, jobs, outbox" as db <<Data Store>>
 folder "Media / evidence" as media <<Data Store>>
 database "Search Index\nRebuildable" as idx <<Data Store>>
}
rectangle "iPhone Bridge\nConditional free installation" as ios <<Application>>
rectangle "Apple Health / Screen Time\nAuthorized access to verify" as apple <<External>>
rectangle "T-Bank" as bank <<External>>
owner --> ui : Local interaction
ui --> core : Application API / HTTP JSON + SSE
core --> tg : Poll / send (protocol to verify)
core --> ai : Typed inference request
core --> agent : Authorized system observations
core --> db : Exclusive business write ownership
core --> media : Durable inputs / evidence
core --> idx : Derived index write / read
core --> bank : Read adapter (unverified)
ios --> apple : Health access (unverified)
ios --> core : Authorized observation batches (TBD)
agent --> apple : Screen Time feasibility unknown
note bottom of core
Native Core is default; Docker optional after qualification.
AI / native API access may stay on host.
No direct UI / AI database writes.
end note
@enduml
